<http://purl.org/spar/amo/leadsTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.org/spar/amo/Warrant> .
<http://purl.org/spar/amo/leadsTo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "By means of the property chain defined, the assertion that links a warrant to the relative claim is automatically inferred starting from the high-level description of an argument (realized through the sub-properties of 'involves' and their inverse properties)."@en .
